module test.claim.c_roadmap2_closing_hardening_witness

// HARDENING WITNESSES for the review-91654/91662 follow-up findings (manager message f880dadc, items 2 and 3;
// item 1's route claims live in this file too). Each claim is the ROUTE-RED for one fix: it fails on the code
// as it stood before the fix and passes on the fix. The mutant that reddens each is named in its comment; the
// same table lands in the PR body (item 8).
//
// WITNESS, NOT PROOF: the wet claims say what `ls`, the real filesystem and the hold library answer on THIS
// host, not what every host must do.

